{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>You shall not bake it leavened, their portion.</b> Even the remnants are forbidden in leaven (Menachot 55)." "<b>Like the sin-offering and like the guilt-offering.</b> A sinner's meal-offering — it is like a sin-offering; therefore, if its handful was taken not for its own sake it is disqualified. A freewill meal-offering — it is like a guilt-offering; therefore, if its handful was taken not for its own sake it is valid (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:12.651525832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}